{"id":"Wab126812fa8552e1990f2024","zh":"动力相互作用","en":"","name":"动力相互作用","language":"zh","domain":"列车轨道基础结构动力学","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":"系统不同组成部分在动态作用下彼此影响的过程。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wab126812fa8552e1990f2024","text":"动力相互作用","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S70d1fe859431d8cd8706","source_id":"P123","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"基于车辆-轨道耦合动力学基本原理,引入混凝土疲劳损伤本构和砂浆黏弹性-疲劳本构,基于已建立的列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用模型为基础,在铁路工程系统动力学框架内建立了列车循环作用下无砟轨道混凝土结构疲劳损伤动力演化计算模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S2c1cc2e855f10a974a3a","source_id":"P123","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"因为荷载形式不同,本文采用车辆-轨道动力相互作用作为砂浆损伤的荷载源, 而试验采用不同应力水平(0.60,0.65,0.75和0.85) 的等幅值荷载,且显著大于一般列车荷载下砂浆所承受的应力水平,故而疲劳应变幅值要大于本文计算结果。","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":6,"page_end":6}]},{"id":"S6e809763ce22ab1867eb","source_id":"P140","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"视列车、轨道和基础结构为整体系统,以车辆-轨道耦合动力学理论为方法核心,以弹性总势能不变值原理及形成矩阵的“对号入座”法则为建模思路,将三大子系统耦合为动力学统一矩阵方程,建立铁路列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用统一分析模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P140","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S8f814f1621697c29457a","source_id":"P140","page":11,"page_end":11,"language":"zh","text":"在开展多基础结构下超长距离列车−轨道−基础结构动力相互作用全过程分析时,仅需将各基础结构模块化,而上部车轨系统只需建立满足边界误差的有限长度模型即可。","citations":[{"source_id":"P140","page":11,"page_end":11}]}],"sources":{"P123":{"id":"P123","title":"铁路列车−轨道−基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part II:混凝土车致疲劳损伤与空时演化","authors":"徐磊,余志武","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220389","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-ii-train-induced-conc"},"P140":{"id":"P140","title":"铁路列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part I:动力学模型构造与求解","authors":"徐磊","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220719","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-model-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-i-the-dynamics"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W66c7d430a3388b54ab7e864e","name":"dynamic interaction","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W66c7d430a3388b54ab7e864e","name":"dynamic interaction","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W66c7d430a3388b54ab7e864e","name":"dynamic interaction","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P140","title":"铁路列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part I:动力学模型构造与求解","authors":"徐磊","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220719","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-model-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-i-the-dynamics"},{"id":"P123","title":"铁路列车−轨道−基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part II:混凝土车致疲劳损伤与空时演化","authors":"徐磊,余志武","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220389","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-ii-train-induced-conc"}]}